      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the advice. i'm a bit worried though, because the stomach pain is getting kinda sharp sometimes, not just gnawing. if i take the ibuprofen like you said, do you think the omeprazole will definitely protect my stomach lining so i don't get an ulcer or something? i really need the ibuprofen to work so i can sleep.",
